+<div class="note">
+<strong>Why downgrade instead of retry.</strong> Retrying the same variant on a link that just proved it
+cannot deliver it in time only spends the budget again. Asking for less is the only retry that
+changes the odds. The retry announces itself with a request header so the interceptor grants a
+longer budget — and that header is <strong>stripped before the request leaves the device</strong>, because
+if it reached the CDN it would fragment the edge cache key.
+</div>
