+  <tr><td>Compose</td><td><code>@Immutable</code> holder for the loader</td><td><code>FeedImageEngine</code></td><td><code>ImageLoader</code> as a bare param makes the tile unskippable — recomposing every scroll frame</td></tr>
+  <tr><td>Compose</td><td>Cell width computed once</td><td><code>LocalWindowInfo.containerSize</code></td><td>Avoids a <code>BoxWithConstraints</code> subcomposition per tile</td></tr>
